# status.tau - builds the status bar text of tauIDE. Everything it prints
# (Print / PrintInt / PrintChar) becomes the status bar text.

Text tau 1 "Ln "
Text tau 2 ", Col "
Text tau 3 "   |   "
Text tau 4 " lines, "
Text tau 5 " chars"

Host CaretLine r0
Host CaretCol r1
Host LineCount r2
Host TextLen r3

Print 1
PrintInt r0
Print 2
PrintInt r1
Print 3
PrintInt r2
Print 4
PrintInt r3
Print 5
